  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstPlaceableDelivery
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstPlaceableDelivery
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Good work - usually, you'll have to wait for the next work day for the delivery
    of newly ordered items - however, seeing as its your first day, the benefactor
    has splurged a bit for instantaneous shipping!
  - In reality, we already had these items on hand - we just needed to make sure
    you could work the Order Terminal :)
  - Whenever new objects arrive to place in your museum, they must be unpacked from
    the delivery box near the entrance.
  - Go on over there and open things up!
  outlineTag: deliveries
